      "role": "user",
      "content": "The banners are in the mud and the men... they're all gone. I can hear them coming through the pass, damn them. There's no way out of this valley, and no way to fix what i've done. I've lost everything, even my honor. It feels like the gods have just turned their backs on me for good.",
